INSERT INTO `translations_override` VALUES
(1,'sv','Assistant','Assistenten','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(2,'sv','What would you like to chat about today?','Vad vill du chatta om idag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(3,'sv','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied. The mode enables a fluid and coherent dialogue.','I detta läge tillämpas OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell. Läget möjliggör en flytande och sammanhängande dialog.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(4,'sv','How can I assist you today?','Hur kan jag hjälpa dig idag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(5,'sv','All data is stored in Microsoft\'s Swedish data centers, but may be processed within the EU. You can input the same data here as you would share via Teams or SharePoint.','All data lagras i Microsofts svenska datacenter, men kan behandlas inom EU. Du kan ange samma data här som du skulle dela via Teams eller SharePoint.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(6,'sv','Keep in mind that there are customers who do not want us to share their data with Microsoft, and information from our customers should only be used for the purpose it was intended for when the customer provided it.','Tänk på att det finns kunder som inte vill att vi delar deras data med Microsoft, och information från våra kunder ska endast användas för det syfte det var avsett för när kunden lämnade den.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(7,'sv','Image creator','Bildskaparen','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(8,'sv','What would you like me to create an image of?','Vad vill du att jag ska skapa en bild av?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(9,'sv','We recommend reviewing the image carefully to ensure there are no inappropriate elements in the image before it is used.','Vi rekommenderar att du noggrant granskar bilden för att säkerställa att det inte finns några olämpliga element i bilden innan den används.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(10,'sv','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'DALL-E 3\' model is applied to create images based on text descriptions.','I detta läge tillämpas OpenAIs \"DALL-E 3\"-modell för att skapa bilder baserat på textbeskrivningar.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(11,'sv','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s employee handbook and then answer questions.','I detta läge tillämpas OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell för att läsa {customer.company}s personalhandbok och sedan besvara frågor.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(12,'sv','Employee handbook','Personalhandboken','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(13,'sv','GDM Services','Tjänstebeskrivningar','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(14,'sv','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s service descriptions and then answer questions.','I detta läge tillämpas OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell för att läsa {customer.company}s tjänstebeskrivningar och sedan besvara frågor.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(15,'sv','I am a digital AI colleague specialized in assisting those who work in GDM\'s NOC, but I will of course do my best even if you don\'t work there.','Jag är en digital AI-kollega specialiserad på att hjälpa de som jobbar i GDMs NOC, men gör givetvis mitt bästa även om du inte jobbar där.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(16,'sv','I have been trained on \'all\' the knowledge that NOC needs* and can fetch data live from ...','Jag har tränats på \"all\" kunskap som NOC behöver* och kan hämta data live från ...','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(17,'sv','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin Documents, Rutin cases, Norr Wiki, ...','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin Dokument, Rutin ärenden, Norr Wikin, …','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(18,'sv','All data is stored and processed locally in GDM\'s data center from which you can freely work with all GDM\'s data.','All data lagras och behandlas lokalt i GDMs datacenter varav du fritt kan jobba med all GDMs data.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(19,'sv','In this mode, a local model is applied.','I detta läge tillämpas en lokal modell.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(20,'sv','When we use AI, we always have our customers, values, and goals in mind.','När vi använder AI har vi alltid våra kunder, värderingar och mål i åtanke.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(21,'sv','AI Guidelines','AI-Riktlinjer','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(22,'sv','AI can be wrong, so always verify facts and remove biased or inappropriate content. If you suspect plagiarism, check it. It is important that you take responsibility for and stand by the content you use.','AI kan ha fel, så verifiera alltid fakta och ta bort partiskt eller olämpligt innehåll. Om du misstänker plagiat, kontrollera det. Det är viktigt att du tar ansvar för och står för det innehåll du använder.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(23,'sv','We clearly inform when material we use is wholly or mainly generated by AI.','Vi informerar tydligt när det material vi använder är helt eller huvudsakligen genererat av AI.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(24,'sv','I have read and understand the above guidelines.','Jag har läst och förstått ovanstående riktlinjer.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(25,'sv','You need to read and confirm that you understand the guidelines before you can use the service.','Du måste läsa och bekräfta att du förstår riktlinjerna innan du kan använda tjänsten.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(26,'sv','Welcome!','Välkommen!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(27,'sv','Explore and discover the power of our GenAI platform. Take the opportunity to experiment and explore all the possibilities that GenAI offers.','Utforska och upptäck kraften i vår GenAI-plattform. Ta chansen att experimentera och utforska alla möjligheter som GenAI erbjuder.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(28,'sv','Do not hesitate to contact us if you want tips or need help along the way. Good luck and have fun!','Tveka inte att kontakta oss om du vill ha tips eller behöver hjälp längs vägen. Lycka till och ha kul!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(29,'sv','Terms of use: Data is processed in Microsoft\'s data centers in EU and is not used for training. Conversations are not stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Användarvillkor: Data behandlas i Microsofts datacenter inom EU och används inte för träning. Konversationer sparas inte om du inte har aktiverat Historikfunktionen. Vid aktivering får du mer information om vad som gäller.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(30,'sv','Terms of use: Data is processed in GDM\'s Swedish data centers and is not used for training. No data is stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Användarvillkor: Data processas i GDMs svenska datacenter och används naturligtvis inte för träning. Ingen data lagras såvida du inte har aktiverat Historiken. Vid eventuell aktivering får du mer information om vad som gäller.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(31,'sv','If you are unsure about which data you are allowed to share, avoid sharing sensitive or personal information. The assistant must not be used for illegal or inappropriate activities.','Om du är osäker på vilka data du får dela, undvik att dela känslig eller person information. Assistenten får självklart inte användas för olagliga eller olämpliga aktiviteter.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(32,'sv','How can I help you today?','Hur kan jag hjälpa dig idag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(33,'sv','In this mode, your message is processed by a n8n workflow.','I detta läge behandlas ditt meddelande av ett n8n-arbetsflöde.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(34,'sv','**Quick commands:**\n- **#help** – Get a detailed guide on how the system works\n- **#error** – Report an incorrect answer. If I gave you an answer you\'re not satisfied with, use this command to report the error so we can improve the responses.\n- **#customerreport** – Get a report for one of our 60 largest customers (updated weekly) See #help for how to use this.','**Snabbkommandon:**\n- **#hjälp** – Få en utförlig guide om hur systemet fungerar\n- **#fel** – Rapportera ett felaktigt svar. Om jag gett ett svar som du inte blir nöjd med, använd detta kommando för att rapportera felet så vi kan förbättra svaren.\n- **#kundrapport** – Hämta rapport för någon av våra 60 största kunder (uppdateras varje vecka) Se #hjälpen för hur du använder denna.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(35,'sv','**Example getting-started question:**\n*Give me the revenues and margins for SCA for each business service for the latest quarter*','**Exempel på kom-igång fråga:**\n*Ge mig intäkterna och marginalerna för SCA för respektive affärstjänst för senaste kvartalet*','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(36,'no','What would you like to chat about today?','Hva vil du chatte om i dag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(37,'no','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied. The mode enables a fluid and coherent dialogue.','I denne modusen brukes OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell. Modusen muliggjør en flytende og sammenhengende dialog.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(38,'no','How can I assist you today?','Hvordan kan jeg hjelpe deg i dag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(39,'no','All data is stored in Microsoft\'s Swedish data centers, but may be processed within the EU. You can input the same data here as you would share via Teams or SharePoint.','All data lagres i Microsofts svenske datasentre, men kan behandles innenfor EU. Du kan legge inn de samme dataene her som du ville delt via Teams eller SharePoint.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(40,'no','Keep in mind that there are customers who do not want us to share their data with Microsoft, and information from our customers should only be used for the purpose it was intended for when the customer provided it.','Husk at det finnes kunder som ikke vil at vi deler deres data med Microsoft, og informasjon fra våre kunder skal kun brukes til det formålet det var ment for da kunden leverte den.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(41,'no','Image creator','Bildegenerator','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(42,'no','What would you like me to create an image of?','Hva vil du at jeg skal lage et bilde av?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(43,'no','We recommend reviewing the image carefully to ensure there are no inappropriate elements in the image before it is used.','Vi anbefaler at du nøye gjennomgår bildet for å sikre at det ikke er upassende elementer i bildet før det brukes.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(44,'no','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'DALL-E 3\' model is applied to create images based on text descriptions.','I denne modusen brukes OpenAIs \"DALL-E 3\"-modell for å lage bilder basert på tekstbeskrivelser.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(45,'no','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s employee handbook and then answer questions.','I denne modusen brukes OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell til å lese {customer.company}s medarbeiderhåndbok og deretter besvare spørsmål.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(46,'no','Employee handbook','Medarbeiderhåndbok','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(47,'no','GDM Services','Tjenestebeskrivelser','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(48,'no','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s service descriptions and then answer questions.','I denne modusen brukes OpenAIs \"GPT-4o\"-modell til å lese {customer.company}s tjenestebeskrivelser og deretter besvare spørsmål.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(49,'no','I am a digital AI colleague specialized in assisting those who work in GDM\'s NOC, but I will of course do my best even if you don\'t work there.','Jeg er en digital AI-kollega spesialisert på å hjelpe de som jobber i GDMs NOC, men gjør selvfølgelig mitt beste selv om du ikke jobber der.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(50,'no','I have been trained on \'all\' the knowledge that NOC needs* and can fetch data live from ...','Jeg er trent på \"all\" kunnskapen som NOC trenger* og kan hente data live fra ...','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(51,'no','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin Documents, Rutin cases, Norr Wiki, ...','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin Dokument, Rutin saker, Norr Wiki, ...','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(52,'no','All data is stored and processed locally in GDM\'s data center from which you can freely work with all GDM\'s data.','All data lagres og behandles lokalt i GDMs datasenter hvor du fritt kan jobbe med all GDMs data.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(53,'no','In this mode, a local model is applied.','I denne modusen brukes en lokal modell.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(54,'no','When we use AI, we always have our customers, values, and goals in mind.','Når vi bruker AI, har vi alltid kundene, verdiene og målene våre i tankene.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(55,'no','AI Guidelines','AI-retningslinjer','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(56,'no','AI can be wrong, so always verify facts and remove biased or inappropriate content. If you suspect plagiarism, check it. It is important that you take responsibility for and stand by the content you use.','AI kan ta feil, så verifiser alltid fakta og fjern partisk eller upassende innhold. Hvis du mistenker plagiat, sjekk det. Det er viktig at du tar ansvar for og står for innholdet du bruker.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(57,'no','We clearly inform when material we use is wholly or mainly generated by AI.','Vi informerer tydelig når materialet vi bruker er helt eller hovedsakelig generert av AI.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(58,'no','I have read and understand the above guidelines.','Jeg har lest og forstår de ovennevnte retningslinjene.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(59,'no','You need to read and confirm that you understand the guidelines before you can use the service.','Du må lese og bekrefte at du forstår retningslinjene før du kan bruke tjenesten.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(60,'no','Welcome!','Velkommen!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(61,'no','Explore and discover the power of our GenAI platform. Take the opportunity to experiment and explore all the possibilities that GenAI offers.','Utforsk og oppdag kraften i vår GenAI-plattform. Benytt anledningen til å eksperimentere og utforske alle mulighetene GenAI tilbyr.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(62,'no','Do not hesitate to contact us if you want tips or need help along the way. Good luck and have fun!','Ikke nøl med å kontakte oss hvis du vil ha tips eller trenger hjelp underveis. Lykke til og ha det gøy!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(63,'no','Terms of use: Data is processed in Microsoft\'s data centers in EU and is not used for training. Conversations are not stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Vilkår for bruk: Data behandles i Microsofts datasentre i EU og brukes ikke til opplæring. Samtaler lagres ikke med mindre du har aktivert Historikk-funksjonen. Ved aktivering vil du få mer informasjon om hva som gjelder.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(64,'no','Terms of use: Data is processed in Microsofts Swedish data centers but is not used for training. No data is stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Bruksvilkår: Data behandles i Microsofts svenske datasentre, men brukes ikke til trening. Ingen data lagres med mindre du har aktivert Historikk-funksjonen. Ved aktivering vil du få mer informasjon om hva som gjelder.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(65,'no','If you are unsure about which data you are allowed to share, avoid sharing sensitive or personal information. The assistant must not be used for illegal or inappropriate activities.','Hvis du er usikker på hvilke data du har lov til å dele, unngå å dele sensitiv eller personlig informasjon. Assistenten må ikke brukes til ulovlige eller upassende aktiviteter.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(66,'no','How can I help you today?','Hvordan kan jeg hjelpe deg i dag?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(67,'no','In this mode, your message is processed by a n8n workflow.','I denne modusen behandles meldingen din av en n8n-arbeidsflyt.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(68,'no','**Quick commands:**\n- **#help** – Get a detailed guide on how the system works\n- **#error** – Report an incorrect answer. If I gave you an answer you\'re not satisfied with, use this command to report the error so we can improve the responses.\n- **#customerreport** – Get a report for one of our 60 largest customers (updated weekly) See #help for how to use this.','**Hurtigkommandoer:**\n- **#hjelp** – Få en detaljert guide om hvordan systemet fungerer\n- **#feil** – Rapporter et feilaktig svar. Hvis jeg har gitt et svar du ikke er fornøyd med, bruk denne kommandoen for å rapportere feilen slik at vi kan forbedre svarene.\n- **#kunderapport** – Hent rapport for en av våre 60 største kunder (oppdateres hver uke) Se #hjelp for hvordan du bruker denne.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(69,'no','**Example getting-started question:**\n*Give me the revenues and margins for SCA for each business service for the latest quarter*','**Eksempel på kom-i-gang-spørsmål:**\n*Gi meg inntektene og marginene for SCA for respektive forretningstjeneste for siste kvartal*','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(70,'fi','What would you like to chat about today?','Mistä haluaisit keskustella tänään?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(71,'fi','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied. The mode enables a fluid and coherent dialogue.','Tässä tilassa käytetään OpenAI:n \'GPT-4o\'-mallia. Tila mahdollistaa sujuvan ja johdonmukaisen vuoropuhelun.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(72,'fi','How can I assist you today?','Kuinka voin auttaa sinua tänään?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(73,'fi','All data is stored in Microsoft\'s Swedish data centers, but may be processed within the EU. You can input the same data here as you would share via Teams or SharePoint.','Kaikki tiedot tallennetaan Microsoftin ruotsalaisiin datakeskuksiin, mutta niitä voidaan käsitellä EU:n sisällä. Voit syöttää tänne samoja tietoja kuin jakaisit Teamsin tai SharePointin kautta.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(74,'fi','Keep in mind that there are customers who do not want us to share their data with Microsoft, and information from our customers should only be used for the purpose it was intended for when the customer provided it.','Muista, että on asiakkaita, jotka eivät halua meidän jakavan tietojaan Microsoftin kanssa, ja asiakkaidemme tietoja tulee käyttää vain siihen tarkoitukseen, johon ne on annettu.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(75,'fi','Image creator','Kuvien luoja','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(76,'fi','What would you like me to create an image of?','Minkä kuvan haluaisit minun luovan?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(77,'fi','We recommend reviewing the image carefully to ensure there are no inappropriate elements in the image before it is used.','Suosittelemme tarkistamaan kuvan huolellisesti varmistaaksesi, ettei siinä ole sopimattomia elementtejä ennen käyttöä.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(78,'fi','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'DALL-E 3\' model is applied to create images based on text descriptions.','Tässä tilassa käytetään OpenAI:n \'DALL-E 3\'-mallia luomaan kuvia tekstikuvausten perusteella.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(79,'fi','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s employee handbook and then answer questions.','Tässä tilassa käytetään OpenAI:n \'GPT-4o\'-mallia lukemaan {customer.company}:n henkilöstökäsikirjaa ja vastaamaan kysymyksiin.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(80,'fi','Employee handbook','Henkilöstökäsikirja','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(81,'fi','GDM Services','GDM:n palvelut','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(82,'fi','In this mode, OpenAI\'s \'GPT-4o\' model is applied to read {customer.company}\'s service descriptions and then answer questions.','Tässä tilassa käytetään OpenAI:n \'GPT-4o\'-mallia lukemaan {customer.company}:n palvelukuvauksia ja vastaamaan kysymyksiin.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(83,'fi','I am a digital AI colleague specialized in assisting those who work in GDM\'s NOC, but I will of course do my best even if you don\'t work there.','Olen digitaalinen tekoälykollega, joka on erikoistunut auttamaan niitä, jotka työskentelevät GDM:n NOC:ssa, mutta teen tietysti parhaani, vaikka et työskentelisikään siellä.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(84,'fi','I have been trained on \'all\' the knowledge that NOC needs* and can fetch data live from ...','Olen koulutettu \'kaikella\' NOC:n tarvitsemalla tiedolla* ja voin hakea tietoja reaaliajassa ...','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(85,'fi','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin Documents, Rutin cases, Norr Wiki, ...','* Wiki.gdm.se, Rutin-dokumentit, Rutin-tapaukset, Norr Wiki, ...','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(86,'fi','All data is stored and processed locally in GDM\'s data center from which you can freely work with all GDM\'s data.','Kaikki tiedot tallennetaan ja käsitellään paikallisesti GDM:n datakeskuksessa, mistä voit vapaasti työskennellä kaikkien GDM:n tietojen kanssa.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(87,'fi','In this mode, a local model is applied.','Tässä tilassa käytetään paikallista mallia.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(88,'fi','When we use AI, we always have our customers, values, and goals in mind.','Kun käytämme tekoälyä, pidämme aina mielessä asiakkaamme, arvomme ja tavoitteemme.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(89,'fi','AI Guidelines','Tekoälyn ohjeet','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(90,'fi','AI can be wrong, so always verify facts and remove biased or inappropriate content. If you suspect plagiarism, check it. It is important that you take responsibility for and stand by the content you use.','Tekoäly voi olla väärässä, joten tarkista aina faktat ja poista puolueellinen tai sopimaton sisältö. Jos epäilet plagiointia, tarkista se. On tärkeää, että otat vastuun ja seisot käyttämäsi sisällön takana.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(91,'fi','We clearly inform when material we use is wholly or mainly generated by AI.','Ilmoitamme selkeästi, kun käyttämämme materiaali on kokonaan tai pääosin tekoälyn tuottamaa.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(92,'fi','I have read and understand the above guidelines.','Olen lukenut ja ymmärtänyt yllä olevat ohjeet.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(93,'fi','You need to read and confirm that you understand the guidelines before you can use the service.','Sinun tulee lukea ja vahvistaa, että ymmärrät ohjeet, ennen kuin voit käyttää palvelua.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(94,'fi','Welcome!','Tervetuloa!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(95,'fi','Explore and discover the power of our GenAI platform. Take the opportunity to experiment and explore all the possibilities that GenAI offers.','Tutustu ja löydä GenAI-alustan voima. Hyödynnä tilaisuus kokeilla ja tutkia kaikkia GenAI:n tarjoamia mahdollisuuksia.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(96,'fi','Do not hesitate to contact us if you want tips or need help along the way. Good luck and have fun!','Älä epäröi ottaa yhteyttä, jos haluat vinkkejä tai tarvitset apua matkan varrella. Onnea ja pidä hauskaa!','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(97,'fi','Terms of use: Data is processed in Microsoft\'s data centers in EU and is not used for training. Conversations are not stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Käyttöehdot: Tietoja käsitellään Microsoftin tietokeskuksissa EU:ssa, eikä niitä käytetä koulutukseen. Keskusteluja ei tallenneta, ellei Historia-toimintoa ole aktivoitu. Aktivoinnin yhteydessä saat lisätietoja sovellettavista käytännöistä.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(98,'fi','Terms of use: Data is processed in Microsofts Swedish data centers but is not used for training. No data is stored unless you have activated the History function. Upon activation, you will get more information about what applies.','Käyttöehdot: Tietoja käsitellään Microsoftin Ruotsin datakeskuksissa, mutta niitä ei käytetä koulutukseen. Tietoja ei tallenneta, ellei olet aktivoinut Historia-toimintoa. Aktivoinnin yhteydessä saat lisätietoja sovellettavista ehdoista.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(99,'fi','If you are unsure about which data you are allowed to share, avoid sharing sensitive or personal information. The assistant must not be used for illegal or inappropriate activities.','Jos et ole varma, mitä tietoja voit jakaa, vältä arkaluonteisten tai henkilökohtaisten tietojen jakamista. Avustajaa ei saa käyttää laittomiin tai sopimattomiin toimintoihin.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(100,'fi','How can I help you today?','Kuinka voin auttaa sinua tänään?','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(101,'fi','In this mode, your message is processed by a n8n workflow.','Tässä tilassa viestisi käsitellään n8n-työnkulussa.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(102,'fi','**Quick commands:**\n- **#help** – Get a detailed guide on how the system works\n- **#error** – Report an incorrect answer. If I gave you an answer you\'re not satisfied with, use this command to report the error so we can improve the responses.\n- **#customerreport** – Get a report for one of our 60 largest customers (updated weekly) See #help for how to use this.','**Pikakomennot:**\n- **#apu** – Saat yksityiskohtaisen oppaan järjestelmän toiminnasta\n- **#virhe** – Ilmoita virheellisestä vastauksesta. Jos olen antanut vastauksen, johon et ole tyytyväinen, käytä tätä komentoa ilmoittaaksesi virheestä, jotta voimme parantaa vastauksia.\n- **#asiakasraportti** – Hae raportti 60 suurimmasta asiakkaastamme (päivitetään viikoittain) Katso #apu saadaksesi lisätietoja käytöstä.','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(103,'fi','**Example getting-started question:**\n*Give me the revenues and margins for SCA for each business service for the latest quarter*','**Esimerkki aloituskysymyksestä:**\n*Anna minulle SCA:n tulot ja marginaalit kullekin liiketoimintapalvelulle viimeiseltä neljännekseltä*','2026-01-13 14:26:38','2026-01-13 14:26:38'),
(104,'sv','In this mode, the \"FLUX.2\" model creates images from text prompts. You can refine generated images or upload your own images to modify them.','I det här läget skapar modellen \"FLUX.2\" bilder från textbeskrivningar. Du kan förfina genererade bilder eller ladda upp egna bilder för att redigera dem.','2026-02-17 17:04:56','2026-02-17 17:04:56'),
(105,'no','In this mode, the \"FLUX.2\" model creates images from text prompts. You can refine generated images or upload your own images to modify them.','I denne modusen lager modellen \"FLUX.2\" bilder fra tekstbeskrivelser. Du kan forbedre genererte bilder eller laste opp egne bilder for å redigere dem.','2026-02-17 17:04:56','2026-02-17 17:04:56'),
(106,'fi','In this mode, the \"FLUX.2\" model creates images from text prompts. You can refine generated images or upload your own images to modify them.','Tässä tilassa \"FLUX.2\"-malli luo kuvia tekstikuvauksista. Voit parantaa luotuja kuvia tai ladata omia kuvia muokattaviksi.','2026-02-17 17:04:56','2026-02-17 17:04:56'),
(107,'sv','This mode uses the GPT‑4.1 model unless Extended Thinking is enabled, in which case it uses the GPT‑5.4 model.','Det här läget använder modellen GPT‑4.1 om inte Utökat tänkande är aktiverat, i vilket fall det använder modellen GPT‑5.4.','2026-04-29 13:25:29','2026-04-29 13:27:48'),
(108,'no','This mode uses the GPT‑4.1 model unless Extended Thinking is enabled, in which case it uses the GPT‑5.4 model.','Denne modusen bruker modellen GPT‑4.1 med mindre Utvidet tenkning er aktivert, og i så fall bruker den modellen GPT‑5.4.','2026-04-29 13:26:03','2026-04-29 13:27:49'),
(109,'fi','This mode uses the GPT‑4.1 model unless Extended Thinking is enabled, in which case it uses the GPT‑5.4 model.','Tämä tila käyttää GPT‑4.1-mallia, ellei Laajennettu ajattelu ole käytössä, jolloin se käyttää GPT‑5.4-mallia.','2026-04-29 13:26:03','2026-04-29 13:27:49'),
